### 1. Admin get member list with paging and filter - success

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/members?page=0&size=10&keyword=member&status=ACTIVE
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}
### 2. Admin get member detail by id - success

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/members/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. Member token tries to access admin member list - should fail

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/members?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


